{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他先让眼前的亲近自然发生，不急着想两人以后会怎样。\",\n      \"key\": \"自然发生\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他提醒自己不必向对方要回应，也不必总揣摩对方的反应，便能安心靠近、自在地关心对方，也喜欢自己不计较。\",\n      \"key\": \"安心靠近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"那时他真觉得，能这样亲近下去，眼下已经够了。\",\n      \"key\": \"已经够了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不敢认定这样的亲近会一直有，眼下就盼这一刻慢些，可时间仍在往前走。\",\n      \"key\": \"盼这一刻慢些\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他一度很想把心意多给一点，热切了一阵，又把分寸收回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"把分寸收回来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B5\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R5\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂不安排关系去向的选择，改为写他如何把注意力放回眼前的亲近；由S01-2提供具体前因，不再把说不清自己怕什么当成充分解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R6\",\n        \"R7\",\n        \"R8\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并不索要回应、不反复揣摩对方反应、自在靠近和给予；保留他喜欢自己不计较的自我感受，删去重复的放下提防和抽象的普遍道理。将这一条写成独立的自我提醒，不让暂缓考虑未来自动推出不期待回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R9\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-3\",\n        \"S02-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"S02-3保留他当时真觉得眼前的亲近已经足够，为后面期待增长留下真实前提。S02-4补出他不敢相信这样的亲近会一直持续，因此尚未失去便已盼时间慢些；同时保留时间仍向前走的另一侧面。两条并存，不把惆怅硬写成满足之后才发生的转折。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-5\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"补入\",\n      \"why\": \"补上原稿没有解释的短暂热切与收回。想多给一点来自当下的亲近，重新收住则由S01-2的顾虑解释；不把珠子里的音乐变化写成心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4b5586e9-970e-425a-9760-4c3ddfc17719", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T184055547254Z", "elapsed_seconds": 443.14, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T18:48:18.705283+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d46586d472e19a30de4d2b061e99a5150d8ce764d86a7be7f0c0573829f85c75", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7